Z||000002||FieroJoe||06-23-2001||12:23 AM||||Why not in the passenger side footwell?  You could even get some scraps of Fiero carpet, and make a little door to open to get the magazine out.  That way, it will be hidden quite well, and nobody riding in your passenger seat will kick it.<P>Or the trunk, but that's just more wires to run.<P>If I get a changer it is going in the footwell or in the trunk.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg"> <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87||||reg||1
